  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nPrincipal (P) = 40,000\n\nAmount (A) = 53,240\n\nRate (r) = 10% per annum\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nA = P (1 + r/100)t\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ 53,240 = 40,000 (1 + 10/100)t\n\n⇒ 53,240 = 40,000 (1.1)t\n\n⇒ 53,240 ÷ 40,000 = (1.1)t\n\n⇒ 1.331 = (1.1)t\n\n⇒ 1.1 × 1.1 × 1.1 = 1.331\n\n⇒ (1.1)³ = 1.331\n\n⇒ t = 3 years\n\n**∴ 40,000 will become 53,240 in 3 years.**",
